### ============================================================
### 42-SpringActuator Production Readiness API Testing (Port: 8142)
### ============================================================

### 1. Kiểm tra Health Check (Kèm Database & ExternalService Custom Health Indicator)
GET http://localhost:8142/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Kiểm tra thông tin ứng dụng (CustomInfoContributor)
GET http://localhost:8142/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### 3. Kiểm tra danh sách Metrics có sẵn
GET http://localhost:8142/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json

### 4. Custom Actuator Endpoint: Xem thống kê đơn hàng (@Endpoint(id = "orders"))
GET http://localhost:8142/actuator/orders
Accept: application/json

### 5. Custom Actuator Endpoint: Cập nhật thống kê đơn hàng (@WriteOperation)
POST http://localhost:8142/actuator/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 6. Business REST API: Lấy thống kê đơn hàng
GET http://localhost:8142/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### 7. Business REST API: Thêm đơn hàng mới
POST http://localhost:8142/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

